y's expected-visitor list\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The badge is printed from the front desk terminal.\",\n      \"line\": 5,\n      \"span\": \"Print a badge from the front desk terminal.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The host's name is written on the badge in the space provided.\",\n      \"line\": 5,\n      \"span\": \"Write the host's name on the badge in the space provided.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The visitor is asked to wear the badge above the waist and in view for the whole visit.\",\n      \"line\": 5,\n      \"span\": \"ask the visitor to wear it above the waist and in view for the whole visit\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Visitors return badges at the front desk on their way out.\",\n      \"line\": 9,\n      \"span\": \"Visitors return badges at the front desk on their way out.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The badge is wiped with the cleaning cloth kept in the top drawer.\",\n      \"line\": 9,\n      \"span\": \"Wipe the badge with the cleaning cloth kept in the top drawer\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The badge is put back in the return tray.\",\n      \"line\": 9,\n      \"span\": \"put it back in the return tray\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Badges in the return tray are re-used the same day.\",\n      \"line\": 9,\n      \"span\": \"Badges in the return tray are re-used the same day.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The visitor's line on the expected-visitor list is marked with an N if a badge is not returned.\",\n      \"line\": 13,\n      \"span\": \"Mark the visitor's line on the expected-visitor list with an N.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"At the end of the day, the list of unreturned badges is sent to the security office.\",\n      \"line\": 13,\n      \"span\": \"At the end of the day, send the list of unreturned badges to the security office.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Badges that have been missing for 7 days are deactivated.\",\n      \"line\": 13,\n      \"span\": \"Badges that have been missing for 7 days are deactivated.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A badge handed in after it was reported missing goes to the security office rather than back into the return tray.\",\n      \"line\": 17,\n      \"span\": \"A badge handed in after it was reported missing goes to the security office rather than back into the return tray.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The security office decides whether to reactivate a badge handed in after it was reported missing.\",\n      \"line\": 17,\n      \"span\": \"The security office decides whether to reactivate it.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Contractors on a job lasting more than one day are issued a week badge instead of a day badge.\",\n      \"line\": 21,\n      \"span\": \"Contractors on a job lasting more than one day are issued a week badge instead of a day badge.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A week badge is valid for 7 days from the date printed on it.\",\n      \"line\": 21,\n      \"span\": \"A week badge is valid for 7 days from the date printed on it.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Contractors sign the contractor register in addition to the visitor list.\",\n      \"line\": 21,\n      \"span\": \"Contractors sign the contractor register in addition to the visitor list.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":7815,"type":"result","duration_ms":7855,"uuid":"dff9058e-fadb-4fff-946b-8d72703b6eca","ttft_stream_ms":857,"time_to_request_ms":92,"first_content_frame_ms":857,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
